    "overview": {
      "visible": true,
      "kicker": "About the summit",
      "heading": "Exploring sustainability through *innovative* minds",
      "text": "FutureMinds Summit Thailand was the first GYN summit: four days at the Le Srivaree Suvarnabhumi Hotel in Bangkok, from 16 to 19 July 2026. Delegates took part in keynotes and policy workshops, built and pitched solutions in the World Got a Problem challenge, joined an AI corner, and closed the summit with a cultural night. The programme delivered organizational and decision-making capability, quantitative research for the SDGs, smart innovation and sustainable industry, and global collaboration and leadership.",
      "image": {
        "src": "/media/gallery/fmst-dsc01894-1.webp",
        "alt": "Panel session at FutureMinds Summit Thailand 2026"
      }
    },
